# App Code — PHP 8.5 Upgrade Rules

Applies to `app/controllers/`, `app/models/`, `app/libraries/`, `app/helpers/`, `app/core/`, `themes/default/views/`.

**ElintOM18.00 only.** Fix syntax in the **existing** file — never delete lines, never rename variables/methods, never replace whole file from another tree.

## Syntax-only checklist (before every edit)

| Check | Pass |
|-------|------|
| No lines/blocks/methods removed | ☐ |
| No `$var`, function, or method renamed | ☐ |
| Same SQL, same calculations, same workflow | ☐ |
| Change is cast, guard, `isset`, `AllowDynamicProperties`, or PHP 8.5 parse fix only | ☐ |
| Diff is minimal (target failing line + smallest guard) | ☐ |

## Fix Pattern

```php
// ❌ PHP 8.5 deprecated — syntax only, logic unchanged
$value = (integer) $row->qty;
$flag = (boolean) $settings->active;

// ✅ Same result, compatible syntax
$value = (int) $row->qty;
$flag = (bool) $settings->active;
```

## Subagent First

Before editing any `app/` file, launch an `explore` subagent to find all related controllers, models, views, and third-party usage for that module. Use `shell` subagent to run PHP and verify errors.

## Rules

- **No deletion** — do not remove code, comments, or branches; add guards **above** existing logic.
- **No renames** — keep all variable, function, method, and property names identical.
- **Patch in place** — edit the ElintOM18.00 file only; **no bulk-copy from any other path**.
- Match existing naming, structure, and CodeIgniter patterns (`MY_Controller`, `page_construct`, model methods).
- Fix null/undefined index warnings with minimal guards — do not restructure conditionals.
- Do not split or rewrite large files (`Sales.php`, `Reports.php`, `Sma.php`) — patch only failing lines.
- Payment callbacks (Razorpay, Paytm, CCAvenue) — fix errors only; keep callback URLs and response handling identical.
- `database.php` subdomain switch — do not change tenant routing logic.

## Module Priority (when testing/fixing)

P1: Auth, POS, Sales, Products, System_settings
P2: Purchases, Reports, Webshop, Restaurant, APIs
P3: Transfers, Quotes, CRM, Production, UrbanPiper

Refer to `upgrade/PHP_UPGRADE_PLAN.md` for full module → screen list.
